{"articleNo":"83573","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=83573&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2013학년도 하계방학 생활관 입사신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.05.24","hit":"8268","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2013학년도 하계방학 생활관 입사신청 안내</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2013학년도 하계방학 기간에 생활관 입사를 희망하는 재학생은 아래 사항을 참조하여 신청 기한 내에 반드시 신청하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">1. 입사자격 : 재학생</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2. 입사제한</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. <font color=\"#ff0000\">구미시 동 거주자 제외</font>(단, 구미시 읍, 면 단위 거주자 입사 가능)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 영구 퇴사자, 관생수칙위반 3회 이상 경고자</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 휴학생, 졸업유예자</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">3. 선발방법</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 푸름관</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">-&nbsp;푸름관&nbsp;3~4동(4인실)만 개방/<font color=\"#ff0000\">푸름관&nbsp;1~2동(1인실/2인실)은 승강기 공사로 인하여 선발하지 않음 </font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">- 모집인원을 초과할 경우 <font color=\"#ff0000\">우선 선발순서</font>→<font color=\"#ff0000\">직전학기 성적순</font>으로 선발</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;※ 우선 선발순서 : 전기간 - 어학특강 - 계절수업(MSC) - 어학 정기강좌 - 계절수업</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">나. 오름관(2인실) : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">선착순 선발</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">4. 선발인원</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt 